hadiths[27]{hadithnumber,text}:
"47","Hamein Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Zamzam bin Amr al Hanafi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Kulaib bin Manfaah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere dada ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasool, main sab se barh kar kis ke sath neki karun, farmaya: apni ammi aur apne abbu ke sath, aur apni behan aur apne bhai ke sath, aur apne maula ke sath jo is ke baad qareeb ho, yeh lazim haq hai aur milai hui rishtedari hai."
"48","Hamein Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abu Awana ne bayan kiya, Abdul Malik bin Umair se, Musa bin Talha se, Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: jab ye ayat nazil hui ke aur apne qareebi rishtedaron ko darao to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam khare hue phir pukara: Ai Bani Kaab bin Luay, apni janon ko aag se bachao, Ai Bani Abd Manaf, apni janon ko aag se bachao, Ai Bani Hashim, apni janon ko aag se bachao, Ai Bani Abdul Muttalib, apni janon ko aag se bachao, Ai Fatima bint Muhammad, apni jan ko aag se bachao, kyunke main Allah ke samne tumhare liye kisi cheez ka ikhtiyar nahi rakhta, magar ye ke tum se meri rishtedari hai jise main us ki tari ke sath tar rakhunga."
"49","Hamein Abu Nuaim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Amr bin Usman bin Abdullah bin Mauhab ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Musa bin Talha ko Hazrat Abu Ayyub Ansari se zikr karte hue suna ke ek dehati safar mein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne aaya to us ne kaha: mujhe batao wo cheez jo mujhe jannat se qareeb kare aur aag se door kare, farmaya: Allah ki ibadat karo aur us ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karo, aur namaz qaim karo, aur zakat do, aur rishtedari joro."
"50","Hamein Ismail bin Abi Uwais ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Sulaiman bin Bilal ne bayan kiya, Muawiya bin Abi Muzarrid se, Saeed bin Yasar se, Abu Huraira se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Allah azza wa jalla ne makhluq ko paida kiya, phir jab us se farigh hua to Rahm khari hui, to Allah ne farmaya: theher, us ne kaha: ye qata talluq se teri panah mangne wale ka maqam hai, farmaya: kya tum razi nahi ho ke jo tumhe jore main use jorun aur jo tumhe kate main use katun, us ne kaha: kyun nahi Ai mere Rab, farmaya: to ye tere liye hai, phir Abu Huraira ne kaha: agar chaho to parho ke phir kya qareeb hai ke agar tum peeth pher lo to zameen mein fasad karo aur apni rishtedariyan kaat dalo."
"51","Hamein al Humaidi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Abu Saad se, Muhammad bin Abi Musa se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: aur rishtedar ko us ka haq do aur miskeen ko aur musafir ko, farmaya: pehle shuru kiya phir use sab se wajibi huquq ka hukm diya, aur use afzal tareen amalon ki rehnumai ki jab us ke paas kuch ho to farmaya: aur rishtedar ko us ka haq do aur miskeen ko aur musafir ko, aur use sikhaya jab us ke paas kuch na ho to kaise kahe, phir farmaya: aur agar tum un se apne Rab ki rehmat ki talash mein munh phero j ki tum ummeed rakhte ho to un se narm baat kaho, achhi wada guftagu goya wo ho chuki ho, aur shayad wo ho jaye agar Allah chahe, aur apna hath apni gardan se bandha hua na rakho ke kuch na do, aur use poora khula bhi na khol do ke jo tumhare paas hai de dalo, phir tum malamat zada betho ke jo tumhare paas baad mein aaye wo tumhe malamat kare aur tumhare paas kuch na paye, thaka hua, farmaya: tumhen us ne thaka diya jise tum de chuke ho."
"52","Hamein Muhammad bin Ubaidullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ibn Abi Hazim ne bayan kiya, Ala se, un ke walid se, Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: ek shakhs Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya to us ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasool, mere kuch rishtedar hain jin se main suluk karta hun aur wo mujh se kat te hain, aur main un se ehsan karta hun aur wo mujh se burai karte hain, aur wo mujh par jahalat karte hain aur main un se burdbari karta hun, farmaya: agar jaisa tum kehte ho waisa hi hai to goya tum unhen garam raakh khila rahe ho, aur jab tak tum is par rahoge Allah ki taraf se un ke muqable mein tumhare sath hamesha ek madadgar rahega."
"53","Hamein Ismail bin Abi Uwais ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe mere bhai ne bayan kiya, Sulaiman bin Bilal se, Muhammad bin Abi Ateeq se, Ibn Shihab se, Abu Salama bin Abdur Rahman se, ke Abur Raddad al Laisi ne unhen khabar di, Abdur Rahman bin Auf se, ke unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah azza wa jalla ne farmaya: Main Rahman hun, aur Main ne Rahm ko paida kiya, aur us ke liye apne naam se naam nikala, to jo use jorega main use jorunga, aur jo use katega main use kaat dunga."
"54","Hamein Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abu Awana ne bayan kiya, Usman bin al Mughira se, Abul Anbas se, unhon ne kaha: main Abdullah bin Amr ke paas al Waht mein dakhil hua yani Taif mein un ki zameen mein, to unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne hamari taraf apni ungli mori phir farmaya: Rahm Rahman se nikli hui shaakh hai, jo use jorega use Allah jorega, aur jo use katega use Allah katega, us ki qayamat ke din khuli tez zaban hogi."
"55","Hamein Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Sulaiman ne bayan kiya, Muawiya bin Abi Muzarrid se, Yazid bin Ruman se, Urwa bin Zubair se, Hazrat Ayesha raziyallahu anha se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Rahm Allah se nikli hui shaakh hai, jo use jorega Allah use jorega, aur jo use katega Allah use katega."
"56","Hamein Abdullah bin Salih ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Lais ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Uqail ne bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Anas bin Malik ne khabar di ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jo pasand kare ke us ke rizq mein kushadgi ki jaye aur us ke nishan me muddat di jaye to use chahiye ke apni rishtedari jore."
"57","Hamein Ibrahim bin al Munzir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Muhammad bin Maan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe mere walid ne bayan kiya, Saeed bin Abi Saeed al Maqburi se, Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: jise khushi ho ke us ke rizq mein kushadgi ki jaye aur us ke nishan me muddat di jaye to use chahiye ke apni rishtedari jore."
"58","Hamein Muhammad bin Kaseer ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne khabar di, Abu Ishaq se, Maghra se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: jo apne Rab se dare aur apni rishtedari jore us ki muddat me izafa kiya jata hai, aur us ka maal zyada hota hai, aur us ke ghar wale us se mohabbat karte hain."
"59","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus bin Abi Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Maghra Abu Mukhariq jo Abdi hain ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ne kaha: jo apne Rab se dara aur apne rishtedaron se sila rehmi ki us ki umar mein muhlat di jayegi aur us ka maal zyada hoga aur us ke ghar wale us se mohabbat karenge."
"60","Haiwa bin Shuraih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Baqiyya ne hum se bayan kiya, Bahir se, Khalid bin Madan se, Miqdam bin Madikarib se ke unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: beshak Allah tumhen tumhari maaon ke baare mein wasiyyat karta hai, phir tumhen tumhari maaon ke baare mein wasiyyat karta hai, phir tumhen tumhare baapon ke baare mein wasiyyat karta hai, phir tumhen qareeb tar phir qareeb tar ke baare mein wasiyyat karta hai."
"61","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khazraj bin Usman Abu al Khattab Sadi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Abu Ayyub Sulaiman jo Usman bin Affan ke maula hain ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: hamare paas Abu Huraira jumeraat ki shaam juma ki raat ko aaye to unhon ne kaha: main har rishta todne wale par qasam daal kar kehta hun ke woh hamare paas se zaroor uth kar chala jaye, to koi shakhs khada na hua hatta ke unhon ne teen martaba kaha, phir ek naujawan apni phuphi ke paas gaya jis se us ne do saal se talluq tod rakha tha, to woh us ke andar gaya, to us ne us se kaha: aye mere bhai ke bete, tujhe kya cheez laayi hai, us ne kaha: main ne Abu Huraira ko aisa aisa kehte hue suna hai, us ne kaha: us ke paas wapas ja aur us se pooch ke us ne yeh kyun kaha hai, us ne kaha: main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: beshak bani Adam ke aamaal Allah tabarak wa taala par har jumeraat ki shaam juma ki raat ko pesh kiye jate hain, to woh rishta todne wale ka amal qabool nahin karta."
"62","Muhammad bin Imran bin Abi Laila ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub bin Jabir Hanafi ne hum se bayan kiya, Adam bin Ali se, Ibn Umar se: aadmi jo kuch apni jaan par aur apne ghar walon par sawab ki niyyat se kharch karta hai magar Allah taala us par usay ajr dega, aur us se shuru kar jis ki tu kifalat karta hai, phir agar kuch zyada bache to qareeb tar phir qareeb tar ko de, aur agar kuch zyada bache to dusron ko de."
"63","Ubaidullah bin Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sulaiman Abu Idam ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: main ne Abdullah bin Abi Aufa ko kehte hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat hai ke aap ne farmaya: beshak rehmat us qaum par nazil nahin hoti jin mein rishta todne wala ho."
"64","Abdullah bin Saleh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Lais ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Uqail ne bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, mujhe Muhammad bin Jubair bin Mutim ne khabar di ke Jubair bin Mutim ne unhen khabar di ke unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: rishta todne wala jannat mein dakhil nahin hoga."
"65","Hajjaj bin Minhal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Muhammad bin Abdul Jabbar ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: main ne Muhammad bin Kaab ko suna ke unhon ne Abu Huraira ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se hadees bayan karte hue suna, aap ne farmaya: beshak rehem Rehman se mili hui ek shaakh hai, woh kehti hai: aye mere Rab, mujh par zulm kiya gaya, aye mere Rab, mujhe kaat diya gaya, aye mere Rab, main main, aye mere Rab, aye mere Rab, to woh usay jawab deta hai: kya tu is par raazi nahin ke jo tujhe kaate main usay kaat dun aur jo tujhe jode main usay jodun."
"66","Adam bin Abi Iyas ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saeed bin Saman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Abu Huraira ko bachchon aur bewaqoofon ki hukumat se panaah maangte hue suna, to Saeed bin Saman ne kaha: to mujhe Ibn Hasana Juhani ne khabar di ke us ne Abu Huraira se kaha: is ki nishaani kya hai, unhon ne kaha: ke rishte tode jayenge aur gumrah karne wale ki itaat ki jayegi aur hidayat dene wale ki nafarmani ki jayegi."
"67","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uyaina bin Abdur Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne apne waalid ko Abu Bakra se hadees bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: rishta todne aur zulm se badh kar koi gunaah is laayeq nahin ke Allah us ke karne wale ke liye duniya mein saza mein jaldi kare us ke saath jo woh aakhirat mein us ke liye zakheera karta hai."
"68","Muhammad bin Kaseer ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne khabar di, Amash se aur Hasan bin Amr se aur Fitr se, Mujahid se, Abdullah bin Amr se, Sufyan ne kaha: Amash ne isay Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam tak marfu bayan nahin kiya aur Hasan aur Fitr ne isay Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se marfu bayan kiya, aap ne farmaya: sila rehmi karne wala badla dene wala nahin hai lekin sila rehmi karne wala woh hai ke jab us ka rishta toda jaye to woh usay jode."
"69","Malik bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa bin Abdur Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, Talha se, Abdur Rahman bin Ausaja se, Bara se, unhon ne kaha: ek dehati aaya to us ne kaha: aye Allah ke Nabi, mujhe aisa amal sikhaein jo mujhe jannat mein dakhil kare, aap ne farmaya: agar tune khutba mukhtasar kiya hai to tune sawal bahut bada kiya hai, jaan aazaad kar aur gardan chhuda, us ne kaha: kya yeh dono ek hi nahin hain, aap ne farmaya: nahin, jaan aazaad karna yeh hai ke tu khud jaan aazaad kare aur gardan chhudana yeh hai ke tu gardan chhudane mein madad kare aur zyada doodh dene wali bakri aariyat ke taur par dena aur rishtedar par ehsaan karna, phir agar tu is ki taaqat na rakhe to neki ka hukum de aur burai se mana kar, phir agar tu is ki taaqat na rakhe to apni zabaan ko khair ke siwa har cheez se rok kar rakh."
"70","Abu al Yaman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Shuaib ne khabar di, Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Urwa bin Zubair ne khabar di ke Hakeem bin Hizam ne unhen khabar di ke unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se kaha: aap ka kya khayal hai un kaamon ke baare mein jin ke zariye main jahiliyyat mein ibadat karta tha, sila rehmi se aur gulaam aazaad karne se aur sadqa se, to kya mujhe un mein ajr milega, Hakeem ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: tu us bhalai ke saath Islam laya hai jo pehle guzar chuki hai."
"71","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abda ne hamein khabar di, Ubaidullah se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, Umar ne ek siyara hulla dekha to kaha: Ya Rasulallah, kash aap ye kharid lete, phir aap ise Juma ke din pehente aur wafud ke liye jab wo aap ke pas aate, to unhon ne farmaya: Ae Umar, ise to wahi pehenta hai jis ka koi hissa nahi, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko us mein se kai hulle tohfe mein diye gaye, pas unhon ne Umar ko us mein se ek hulla tohfe mein diya, phir Umar Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pas aaye aur kaha: Ya Rasulallah, aap ne ye mere pas bheja halanke main ne aap ko suna aap ne us ke bare mein jo kaha so kaha, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne ye tumhein is liye tohfe mein nahi diya ke tum ise pehno, main ne to ye tumhein is liye tohfe mein diya hai ke tum ise bech do ya ise pehna do, phir Umar ne use apne us bhai ko tohfe mein de diya jo un ki maan ki taraf se tha jo mushrik tha."
"72","Amr bin Khalid ne hum se hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Attab bin Bashir ne hum se hadith bayan ki, Ishaq bin Rashid se, Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Muhammad bin Jubair bin Mutim ne hadith bayan ki, ke Jubair bin Mutim ne unhein khabar di, ke unhon ne Umar bin Khattab raziyallahu anhu ko mimbar par kehte hue suna: Apne nasab seekho, phir apne rishtedaron se sila rehmi karo, Allah ki qasam beshak aadmi aur us ke bhai ke darmiyan koi baat ho jati hai, aur agar wo jan le jo us ke aur us ke darmiyan rishtedari ka andruni rishta hai to wo use us ki behurmati se zaroor rok dega."
"73","Ahmad bin Yaqub ne hum se hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ishaq bin Said bin Amr ne hamein khabar di, ke unhon ne apne walid ko hadith bayan karte hue suna, Ibn Abbas se, ke unhon ne farmaya: Apne nasab yaad rakho, tum apne rishtedaron se sila rehmi karoge, pas beshak rishtedari ke hote hue koi doori nahi jab use qareeb kiya jaye agarche wo door ho, aur us ke hote hue koi qurbat nahi jab use door kiya jaye agarche wo qareeb ho, aur har rishtedari Qayamat ke din apne wale ke samne aane wali hai, us ke haq mein silae rehmi ki gawahi degi agar us ne use joda tha, aur us ke khilaf qata rehmi ki gawahi degi agar us ne use kata tha."
